    "text": "Portsmouth\nThis Iconic New Hampshire Restaurant Sign Has Become a Local Landmark\nBy Sarah Sullivan,\n4 hours agoIf you don't know where this sign comes from, you might not be from the Seacoast of New Hampshire. Located on Route 1 in Portsmouth is the Iconic Yoken's Restaurant Neon Sign. Yoken's restaurant was in business for years until it closed around 2002. At that time, we almost lost the iconic sign.\n1",
